# This directory holds one deliberate binary asset: demo.gif.
#
# The root .gitignore excludes *.gif and the whole .playwright-mcp/ recording
# workspace, because raw video and QA frames must never enter history. This one
# file is the exception: it is the demonstration the README embeds, it was
# reviewed frame by frame, and it lives here rather than in the recording
# workspace so the exclusion of that workspace stays absolute.
#
# Keep it the only binary under docs/. If it grows past a few megabytes,
# re-encode it smaller instead of adding a second copy.
!demo.gif
